    "created_at": "2020-10-21T03:11:16Z",
    "updated_at": "2020-10-21T03:22:23Z",
    "body": "For instance, there is a canvas for rendering watermarks, and hope it is not able to unmount:\r\n\r\n```html\r\n<canvas id=\"watermarks\" />\r\n```\r\n\r\n```js\r\nconst canvas = document.createElement('canvas', {unmountable : true}); // unable to unmount from DOM\r\ncanvas.id = watermarks;\r\ndocument.body.appendChild(canvas);\r\ncanvas.parentNode().removeChild(canvas); // Throw error: the node is unable to unmount from DOM\r\n```",
    "author_association": "NONE",
    "pin": null,
